---
interface Props { serviceName?: string; }
const { serviceName = '' } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="sd-section section-white" id="flow">
  <div class="sd-container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="kicker">FLOW</span>
      <h2>ご利用の流れ｜最短当日で業者紹介</h2>
      <p>{serviceName ? `${serviceName}の業者紹介を3ステップで完結します` : '業者紹介を3ステップで完結します'}</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="proc-steps">
      <li class="proc-step">
        <div class="proc-step-header">
          <span class="proc-step-num">STEP 1</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>フォームで簡単入力</h3>
        <p>施設情報・要件・連絡先を入力。所要時間は約1分で完了します。</p>
      </li>
      <li class="proc-step proc-step--arrow">
        <div class="proc-step-header">
          <span class="proc-step-num">STEP 2</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>条件に合う業者をご紹介</h3>
        <p>登録資格・実績・対応エリアを確認して、最大3社をご紹介します。</p>
      </li>
      <li class="proc-step proc-step--arrow">
        <div class="proc-step-header">
          <span class="proc-step-num">STEP 3</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="9 11 12 14 22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>見積もりを比較してご契約</h3>
        <p>業者から直接見積もりが届きます。内容を比べて、納得できた業者に発注してください。</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.proc-steps {
  list-style: none;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 0;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
  position: relative;
}
.proc-step {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 28px 24px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
  position: relative;
}
.proc-step--arrow::before {
  content: '→';
  position: absolute;
  left: -20px;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  color: var(--blue);
  font-weight: 900;
  z-index: 1;
}
.proc-step-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.proc-step-num {
  font-size: .72rem;
  font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--blue);
  background: var(--blue-light);
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: 99px;
  letter-spacing: .06em;
}
.proc-step-header svg {
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
  color: var(--blue);
  opacity: .6;
}
.proc-step h3 {
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--gray-900);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.proc-step p {
  font-size: .875rem;
  color: var(--gray-700);
  line-height: 1.65;
}
@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .proc-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
  .proc-step--arrow::before { left: 50%; top: -20px; transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(90deg); }
}
</style>
